<title>UK: UK government says plans tobacco ads ban bill soon.</title>
<headline>UK government says plans tobacco ads ban bill soon.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The government said on Wednesday it plans to publish a draft bill soon for an effective ban on tobacco advertising as part of a drive to reduce smoking in Britain.</p>
<p>&quot;A White Paper (policy document) will be published on measures to reduce tobacco consumption, including legislation to ban tobacco advertising,&quot; Queen Elizabeth said in her speech opening the new parliament.</p>
</text>
